# Public API (coord:*)
  @api coord:register(name, moduleName, extra)  @ 317-322
  @api coord:setActive(name)  @ 326-342
      @contract  setActive(name) no-ops if name==active; else unbind outgoing, swap scope, bind incoming  @ 324
      @contract  tracker's no-arg bind resolves its stored selection; renderBody keeps it current  @ 325
  @api coord:returnToArrange()  @ 345-348
      @contract  tracker back to arrange; no reveal (cursor never left). No-op if arrange unregistered.  @ 344
  @api coord:getFacade(name)  @ 351
      @contract  resolve a published page facade by name; the contents are owned by the publishing page  @ 350
  @api coord:previousPage()  @ 354
      @contract  the page active immediately before the current one; closeEditor returns here  @ 353
  @api coord:reloadAfterExternalMutation()  @ 358-363
      @contract  invoke after firing a REAPER action that mutates the bound take from inside a frame (Ctrl-Z, Ctrl-Shift-Z). The watcher's end-of-frame baseline would otherwise absorb the mutation; this reloads now so tm/vm stay coherent with the take.  @ 356
      @invariant  mirror resync precedes reload — see docs/coordinator.md § Undo mid-frame  @ 357
  @api coord:onExternalCommand(extKey, command)  @ 366-368
      @contract  registers an ExtState key→command bridge polled each frame to fire Continuum commands  @ 365
  @api coord:quit()  @ 370
  @api coord:run(handler)  @ 372
      @contract  handler wraps every deferred frame; without it, post-frame-1 errors raise raw dialogs  @ 371

